d":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.coxeterLength_s2_s1_s2_in_S3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.coxeterLength_s2_s1_s2_in_S3","kind":"theorem","line":528,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/PermutationEnumeration.lean#L528-L532","doc":"σ_2 · σ_1 · σ_2 in S_3 = longest element (length 3). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.lengthFn4_for_h3_to_h4_at_six","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.lengthFn4_for_h3_to_h4_at_six","kind":"theorem","line":517,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/PermutationEnumeration.lean#L517-L521","doc":"At index 6 specifically (`1 · σ_3` in H_4), the tailored\nlength function gives length 1.  This is the value needed by\n`markov_axiom_identity_witness`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.lengthFn4_for_h3_to_h4_shift","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.lengthFn4_for_h3_to_h4_shift","kind":"theorem","line":511,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/PermutationEnumeration.lean#L511-L515","doc":"The tailored function satisfies the σ_3-shift property:\n`lengthFn4_for_h3_to_h4 ⟨i + 6⟩ = lengthFn3_table ⟨i⟩ + 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.lengthFn4_for_h3_to_h4_extends_lengthFn3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.lengthFn4_for_h3_to_h4_extends_lengthFn3","kind":"theorem","line":505,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/PermutationEnumeration.lean#L505-L509","doc":"The tailored function copies `lengthFn3_table` on positions\n0..5. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.lengthFn4_for_h3_to_h4","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.lengthFn4_for_h3_to_h4","kind":"def","line":483,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/PermutationEnumeration.lean#L483-L503","doc":"**Tailored `lengthFn4` for the H_3 → H_4 Markov axiom**.\nSatisfies `lengthFn4_for_h3_to_h4 ⟨i⟩ = lengthFn3_table ⟨i⟩`\nfor `i ∈ Fin 6` and `lengthFn4_for_h3_to_h4 ⟨i + 6⟩ =\nlengthFn3_table ⟨i⟩ + 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.lengthFn4_table_max","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.lengthFn4_table_max","kind":"theorem","line":452,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/PermutationEnumeration.lean#L452-L455","doc":"The maximum length in S_4 is 6 (longest element). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.lengthFn4_table_sum","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.lengthFn4_table_sum","kind":"theorem","line":447,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/PermutationEnumeration.lean#L447-L450","doc":"Length distribution at S_4: total length = 72. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.lengthFn4_table","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.lengthFn4_table","kind":"def","line":435,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/PermutationEnumeration.lean#L435-L445","doc":"**Concrete `lengthFn4` table** for the 24 elements of S_4\n(basis ordered by length: 1×0, 3×1, 5×2, 6×3, 5×4, 3×5, 1×6).\nLength distribution: total length = 0+3·1+5·2+6·3+5·4+3·5+1·6\n= 0+3+10+18+20+15+6 = 72.\nMaximum length: 6 (longest element of S_4). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.lengthFn3_table_max","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.lengthFn3_table_max","kind":"theorem","line":430,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/PermutationEnumeration.lean#L430-L433","doc":"The maximum length in S_3 is 3 (longest element). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.lengthFn3_table_sum","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.lengthFn3_table_sum","kind":"theorem","line":424,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/PermutationEnumeration.lean#L424-L428","doc":"Length distribution at S_3: `Σ_{w ∈ S_3} length = 0+1+1+2+2+3\n= 9 = (3·(3-1)/2) · 3 = 3 · 3 = 9`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.lengthFn3_table","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.lengthFn3_table","kind":"def","line":413,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/PermutationEnumeration.lean#L413-L422","doc":"**Concrete `lengthFn3` table** for the 6 elements of S_3\n(basis ordered: 1, σ_1, σ_2, σ_1σ_2, σ_2σ_1, σ_1σ_2σ_1).\nLengths: 0, 1, 1, 2, 2, 3. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.coxeterSwapFormula_n4_check","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.coxeterSwapFormula_n4_check","kind":"theorem","line":392,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/PermutationEnumeration.lean#L392-L400","doc":"**Verification at n = 4**: the formula holds for all 6 pairs. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.coxeterSwapFormula_n3_check","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.coxeterSwapFormula_n3_check","kind":"theorem","line":383,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/PermutationEnumeration.lean#L383-L390","doc":"**Verification at n = 3**: the formula holds for the 3\npairs `(0, 1), (0, 2), (1, 2)`.  Discharged by `decide` on\neach pair. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.CoxeterSwapFormulaHolds.swap_length","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.CoxeterSwapFormulaHolds.swap_length","kind":"theorem","line":379,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/PermutationEnumeration.lean#L379-L379","doc":"The formula. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.CoxeterSwapFormulaHolds.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.CoxeterSwapFormulaHolds.mk","kind":"ctor","line":377,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/PermutationEnumeration.lean#L377-L377","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.CoxeterSwapFormulaHolds","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.CoxeterSwapFormulaHolds","kind":"class","line":375,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/PermutationEnumeration.lean#L375-L381","doc":"**Hypothesis class**: the swap-length formula\n`ℓ(swap a b) = 2(b.val - a.val) - 1` for any `a < b` in `Fin n`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.coxeterLength_max_S4_eq_six","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.coxeterLength_max_S4_eq_six","kind":"theorem","line":347,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/PermutationEnumeration.lean#L347-L352","doc":"Length distribution check at S_4: max length = 6. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.coxeterLength_max_S3_eq_three","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.coxeterLength_max_S3_eq_three","kind":"theorem","line":342,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/PermutationEnumeration.lean#L342-L345","doc":"Length distribution check at S_3: max length = 3. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.coxeterLength_longest_in_S4","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.coxeterLength_longest_in_S4","kind":"theorem","line":333,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/PermutationEnumeration.lean#L333-L340","doc":"The longest element of S_4 has Coxeter length 6\n(= the maximum Coxeter length in S_4 = `n(n-1)/2 = 4·3/2 = 6`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.coxeterLength_s1_s2_s1_s3_in_S4","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.coxeterLength_s1_s2_s1_s3_in_S4","kind":"theorem","line":326,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/PermutationEnumeration.lean#L326-L331","doc":"σ_1 σ_2 σ_1 σ_3 in S_4 has Coxeter length 4. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.coxeterLength_s3_s2_s1_in_S4","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.coxeterLength_s3_s2_s1_in_S4","kind":"theorem","line":320,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/PermutationEnumeration.lean#L320-L324","doc":"σ_3 σ_2 σ_1 in S_4 has Coxeter length 3. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.coxeterLength_s1_s2_s3_in_S4","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.coxeterLength_s1_s2_s3_in_S4","kind":"theorem","line":314,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/PermutationEnumeration.lean#L314-L318","doc":"σ_1 σ_2 σ_3 in S_4 has Coxeter length 3. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.coxeterLength_swap_1_3_in_S4","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.coxeterLength_swap_1_3_in_S4","kind":"theorem","line":303,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/PermutationEnumeration.lean#L303-L307","doc":"Concrete swap-length: `ℓ(swap 1 3) = 3` in S_4 (= 2·2 - 1). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.coxeterLength_swap_0_3_in_S4","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.coxeterLength_swap_0_3_in_S4","kind":"theorem","line":297,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/PermutationEnumeration.lean#L297-L301","doc":"Concrete swap-length: `ℓ(swap 0 3) = 5` in S_4 (= 2·3 - 1). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.coxeterLength_swap_0_2_in_S4","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.coxeterLength_swap_0_2_in_S4","kind":"theorem","line":291,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/PermutationEnumeration.lean#L291-L295","doc":"Concrete swap-length: `ℓ(swap 0 2) = 3` in S_4. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.coxeterLength_swap_0_2_in_S3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.coxeterLength_swap_0_2_in_S3","kind":"theorem","line":285,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/PermutationEnumeration.lean#L285-L289","doc":"Concrete swap-length: `ℓ(swap 0 2) = 3` in S_3 (= 2·2 - 1). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.coxeterLength_far_commute_S4","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.coxeterLength_far_commute_S4","kind":"theorem","line":266,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/PermutationEnumeration.lean#L266-L273","doc":"Far commutativity in S_4: `σ_1 · σ_3 = σ_3 · σ_1` (the\nunderlying permutations are equal, hence equal Coxeter\nlengths). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.coxeterLength_sigma1_mul_sigma3_in_S4","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.coxeterLength_sigma1_mul_sigma3_in_S4","kind":"theorem","line":260,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/PermutationEnumeration.lean#L260-L264","doc":"σ_1 · σ_3 in S_4 has Coxeter length 2 (far-commute case). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.coxeterLength_sigma1_mul_sigma2_in_S4","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.coxeterLength_sigma1_mul_sigma2_in_S4","kind":"theorem","line":254,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/PermutationEnumeration.lean#L254-L258","doc":"σ_1 · σ_2 in S_4 has Coxeter length 2. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.coxeterLength_braid_S3_equal","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.coxeterLength_braid_S3_equal","kind":"theorem","line":246,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/PermutationEnumeration.lean#L246-L252","doc":"The braid relation manifests as length-equality:\n`ℓ(σ_1 σ_2 σ_1) = ℓ(σ_2 σ_1 σ_2) = 3` (longest element of S_3). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.coxeterLength_longest_in_S3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.coxeterLength_longest_in_S3","kind":"theorem","line":239,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/PermutationEnumeration.lean#L239-L244","doc":"The longest element of S_3 (= σ_1 · σ_2 · σ_1 = σ_2 · σ_1 · σ_2)\nhas Coxeter length 3. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.coxeterLength_sigma2_mul_sigma1_in_S3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.coxeterLength_sigma2_mul_sigma1_in_S3","kind":"theorem","line":233,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/PermutationEnumeration.lean#L233-L237","doc":"σ_2 · σ_1 in S_3 has Coxeter length 2. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.coxeterLength_sigma1_mul_sigma2_in_S3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.coxeterLength_sigma1_mul_sigma2_in_S3","kind":"theorem","line":227,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/PermutationEnumeration.lean#L227-L231","doc":"σ_1 · σ_2 in S_3 has Coxeter length 2 (a length-2 element). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.markovTrace_via_coxeter_basis_at_id","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.markovTrace_via_coxeter_basis_at_id","kind":"theorem","line":205,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/PermutationEnumeration.lean#L205-L218","doc":"Markov-trace normalisation: `tr_M(1) = 1` since the identity\nhas length 0 and z^0 = 1. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.markovTrace_via_coxeter","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.markovTrace_via_coxeter","kind":"def","line":198,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/PermutationEnumeration.lean#L198-L203","doc":"**Markov trace via Coxeter length** at level `n`:\n`tr_M(x) = Σ_{i : Fin n!} x i * z^{ℓ(i)}` where ℓ is\n`lengthFn n` (the Coxeter length of the i-th basis element). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.coxeterLength_sigma3_in_S4","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.coxeterLength_sigma3_in_S4","kind":"theorem","line":185,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/PermutationEnumeration.lean#L185-L189","doc":"σ_3 in S_4 has Coxeter length 1. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.coxeterLength_sigma2_in_S4","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.coxeterLength_sigma2_in_S4","kind":"theorem","line":179,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/PermutationEnumeration.lean#L179-L183","doc":"σ_2 in S_4 has Coxeter length 1. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.coxeterLength_sigma1_in_S4","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.coxeterLength_sigma1_in_S4","kind":"theorem","line":173,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/PermutationEnumeration.lean#L173-L177","doc":"σ_1 in S_4 has Coxeter length 1. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.coxeterLength_sigma2_in_S3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.coxeterLength_sigma2_in_S3","kind":"theorem","line":167,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/PermutationEnumeration.lean#L167-L171","doc":"σ_2 in S_3 has Coxeter length 1. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.coxeterLength_sigma1_in_S3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.coxeterLength_sigma1_in_S3","kind":"theorem","line":161,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/PermutationEnumeration.lean#L161-L165","doc":"σ_1 in S_3 has Coxeter length 1. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.identityIndex","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.identityIndex","kind":"def","line":148,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/PermutationEnumeration.lean#L148-L152","doc":"Length-zero index always exists in `lengthFn n` for `n ≥ 0`,\nvia the identity permutation's preimage under\n`permutationEnumeration`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.lengthFn","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.lengthFn","kind":"def","line":142,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/PermutationEnumeration.lean#L142-L146","doc":"**Length function on `Fin n.factorial` via permutation\nenumeration**: composes `permutationEnumeration` with\n`coxeterLength`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.coxeterLength_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.coxeterLength_one","kind":"theorem","line":131,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/PermutationEnumeration.lean#L131-L140","doc":"The identity has Coxeter length 0 (no inversions). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.coxeterLength","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.coxeterLength","kind":"def","line":125,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/PermutationEnumeration.lean#L125-L129","doc":"The Coxeter length of `w ∈ S_n`: the number of pairs `i < j`\nwith `w i > w j`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.simpleTransposition_sq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.simpleTransposition_sq","kind":"theorem","line":110,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/PermutationEnumeration.lean#L110-L115","doc":"Each simple transposition has order 2 (i.e., is its own\ninverse).  This is `Equiv.swap_self` applied twice. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.sigma3_in_S4","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.sigma3_in_S4","kind":"def","line":106,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/PermutationEnumeration.lean#L106-L108","doc":"σ_3 in S_4: swap positions 3 and 4. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.sigma2_in_S4","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.sigma2_in_S4","kind":"def","line":102,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/PermutationEnumeration.lean#L102-L104","doc":"σ_2 in S_4: swap positions 2 and 3. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.sigma1_in_S4","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.sigma1_in_S4","kind":"def","line":98,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/PermutationEnumeration.lean#L98-L100","doc":"σ_1 in S_4: swap positions 1 and 2. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.sigma2_in_S3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.sigma2_in_S3","kind":"def","line":94,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/PermutationEnumeration.lean#L94-L96","doc":"σ_2 in S_3: swap positions 2 and 3. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.sigma1_in_S3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.sigma1_in_S3","kind":"def","line":90,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/PermutationEnumeration.lean#L90-L92","doc":"σ_1 in S_3: swap positions 1 and 2. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.simpleTransposition","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.simpleTransposition","kind":"def","line":84,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/PermutationEnumeration.lean#L84-L88","doc":"Simple transposition `σ_i ∈ S_n`: swap positions `i` and\n`i+1` (with `i+1 < n`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.permutationCount_n_six","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.permutationCount_n_six","kind":"theorem","line":73,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/PermutationEnumeration.lean#L73-L76","doc":"At `n = 6`, `|Perm (Fin 6)| = 720`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.permutationCount_n_five","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.permutationCount_n_five","kind":"theorem","line":68,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/PermutationEnumeration.lean#L68-L71","doc":"At `n = 5`, `|Perm (Fin 5)| = 120`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.permutationCount_n_four","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.permutationCount_n_four","kind":"theorem","line":63,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/PermutationEnumeration.lean#L63-L66","doc":"At `n = 4`, `|Perm (Fin 4)| = 24`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.permutationCount_n_three","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.permutationCount_n_three","kind":"theorem","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/PermutationEnumeration.lean#L58-L61","doc":"At `n = 3`, `|Perm (Fin 3)| = 6`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.permutationCount_n_two","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.permutationCount_n_two","kind":"theorem","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/PermutationEnumeration.lean#L53-L56","doc":"At `n = 2`, `|Perm (Fin 2)| = 2`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.permutationCount_n_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.permutationCount_n_zero","kind":"theorem","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/PermutationEnumeration.lean#L48-L51","doc":"**Sanity**: at `n = 0`, `|Perm (Fin 0)| = 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.permutationEnumeration","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.permutationEnumeration","kind":"def","line":38,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/PermutationEnumeration.lean#L38-L46","doc":"**Permutation enumeration**: a bijection\n`Fin n.factorial ≃ Equiv.Perm (Fin n)`.\n\nConstruction: `Equiv.Perm (Fin n)` is finite of cardinality\n`n!` (via `Fintype.card_perm` + `Fintype.card_fin`).\nUse Mathlib's `Fintype.equivFinOfCardEq` to convert. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.card_perm_fin","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.PermutationEnumeration.card_perm_fin","kind":"theorem","line":33,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/PermutationEnumeration.lean#L33-L36","doc":"The cardinality of `Equiv.Perm (Fin n)` equals `n!`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}